   teach=['A rule of life is used by monks and laypeople alike: Benedict, Ignatius, Francis de Sales.','Include: daily prayer, weekly Mass, regular Confession, Scripture reading, service, rest.','Revisit your rule each season; do not adopt a rule that crushes you.'],
